# state: any   (the golden cc9b4ced4a0f holds pathfind's profile; lane.accuracy804, #804)
# RalliSport Challenge (4D53000F): CAREER -> Safari SS-1, then DRIVE (throttle held), for the
# owner's 10-04 19:10 report ("no NPC cars visible at all, ever, nor their shadows").
#
# The menu part is rallisport-804.route unchanged (capture 1, 1791136124: it reached SAFARI SS-1
# OPTIONS at +127 s and the first start-race A started the race; race clock 0 = that A + 7.0 s).
# Career is the item lit on the game menu, so it is the mode a player reaches by pressing A.
# Capture 1 stood still at the start and saw no rival from race clock 4 to 46 (0 rival body
# draws in its 600-frame dump, on code from before the #804 fix). This route holds the throttle
# from the spare A on, so the player leaves the start and any rival on the stage can come into
# view. No steering: the shots say how far the car got.
#
#   c1-c3: the countdown (start-race A + 3..6 s). Then the spare A (+8 s), RT held for 40 s with
#   a shot every ~2 s (d1-d20), RT released, then hold shots.
# Triggers rest at min (rallisport-2.returning.route); `axis RT max` is full throttle.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
press START
wait 5
shot title
wait 3
press A
wait 6
press A
wait 6
press A
wait 6
shot event
press A
wait 6
shot car
press A
wait 25
shot options
press A
wait 3
shot c1
wait 1.5
shot c2
wait 1.5
shot c3
wait 2
press A
axis RT max
wait 2
shot d1
wait 2
shot d2
wait 2
shot d3
wait 2
shot d4
wait 2
shot d5
wait 2
shot d6
wait 2
shot d7
wait 2
shot d8
wait 2
shot d9
wait 2
shot d10
wait 2
shot d11
wait 2
shot d12
wait 2
shot d13
wait 2
shot d14
wait 2
shot d15
wait 2
shot d16
wait 2
shot d17
wait 2
shot d18
wait 2
shot d19
wait 2
shot d20
axis RT min
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    wait 15
    shot hold
}
